sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager
    participant Frontend
    participant AuthController
    participant AuthService
    participant DB
    participant Middleware

    Note over Manager,Middleware: Start Impersonation

    Manager->>Frontend: Clicks "Impersonate" on user row
    Frontend->>AuthController: POST /api/platform/auth/impersonate/start {targetUserId, unitId?}
    AuthController->>AuthService: StartImpersonationAsync(managerId, request, ip, ua)
    AuthService->>DB: Validate manager is Manager role
    AuthService->>DB: Load target user (Admin/Resident)
    AuthService->>DB: Verify target in manager's accessible condominiums
    AuthService->>DB: Verify target role != Manager
    AuthService->>DB: Create ImpersonationSession record
    AuthService->>AuthService: Generate JWT with impersonation claims
    AuthService-->>AuthController: ImpersonationResponse {token, expiresAt, ...}
    AuthController-->>Frontend: 200 OK with impersonation token
    Frontend->>Frontend: Store impersonation token, update AuthContext
    Frontend->>Manager: Show ImpersonationBanner "Impersonating as John (Resident)"

    Note over Manager,Middleware: Operating Under Impersonation

    Manager->>Frontend: Calls any API (e.g., GET /platform/maintenance)
    Frontend->>Middleware: Request with impersonation JWT
    Middleware->>Middleware: Extract claims (IsImpersonation=true)
    Middleware->>Middleware: Use ImpersonatedUserId, ImpersonatedRole, CondominiumId for scope check
    Middleware->>DB: Validate condominium access for impersonated context
    Middleware-->>Frontend: Allow/deny based on impersonated role
    Note over Middleware: Audit log records both<br/>Manager ID and Impersonated ID

    Note over Manager,Middleware: End Impersonation

    Manager->>Frontend: Clicks "Exit Impersonation"
    Frontend->>AuthController: POST /api/platform/auth/impersonate/end
    AuthController->>AuthService: EndImpersonationAsync(managerId)
    AuthService->>DB: Update ImpersonationSession (EndedAt, EndReason="ExplicitExit")
    AuthService->>AuthService: Generate Manager's original token
    AuthService-->>AuthController: AuthResponse (Manager's token)
    AuthController-->>Frontend: 200 OK with Manager token
    Frontend->>Frontend: Restore Manager context, hide banner
    Frontend->>Manager: Back to Manager dashboard

    Note over Manager,Middleware: Auto-Expiry (Alternative End)

    loop Background / Middleware check
        Middleware->>Middleware: Check ImpersonationExpiresAt claim
        alt Expired
            Middleware->>DB: Update session EndReason="Expired"
            Middleware-->>Frontend: 401 with code "impersonation_expired"
            Frontend->>Frontend: Clear impersonation, redirect to login
        end
    end